Here is the root cause:
The guest driver did not validate the `quote_buf->out_len` value provided by the host before using it to copy quote data to userspace. This allowed a malicious or compromised host to specify a length larger than the allocated buffer, leading to an out-of-bounds read and potential information leak across container boundaries.

